    "eco_tip_1": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-leaf\" style=\"color: #10b981; font-size: 18px; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\"></i> <strong>Eco-Friendly Choice:</strong> Did you know that by eliminating Database (SQL) queries, you reduced server CPU load by an average of <strong>85%</strong>? This directly saves energy and water used for cooling in data centers.",
    "eco_tip_2": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-tree\" style=\"color: #10b981; font-size: 18px; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\"></i> <strong>Carbon Footprint:</strong> Traditional heavy CMS systems (e.g., WordPress) produce ~0.5g CO2 per page load. PurifyCMS reduces this to nearly zero with its static file-based architecture. Nature thanks you!",
    "eco_tip_3": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-seedling\" style=\"color: #10b981; font-size: 18px; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\"></i> <strong>Green Performance:</strong> PurifyCMS uses so little RAM and CPU that if all heavy websites used this infrastructure, we could prevent massive global electricity waste. Light code, clean nature! 🌳",
    "eco_tip_4": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-earth-europe\" style=\"color: #10b981; font-size: 18px; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\"></i> <strong>Global Impact:</strong> The average website emits 211 kg of CO2 per year. Thanks to PurifyCMS's \"Zero-Overhead\" design, you have reduced your site's environmental load by ~90%.",
    "eco_tip_5": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-droplet\" style=\"color: #10b981; font-size: 18px; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\"></i> <strong>Measurable Savings:</strong> Huge amounts of water are spent cooling database servers. With our SQL-free architecture, you prevent extra heating of server rooms and contribute to the protection of clean water resources.",
